{{Quote|And you said I'd never make it through Mushroom Mesa, Biggs.|Luke Skywalker, to [[Biggs Darklighter]]|<ref name="SW15">[[Star Wars (2015) 15|''Star Wars'' (2015) 15]]</ref>}}
'''Mushroom Mesa''' was a cluster of mesas located near the [[city]] of [[Mos Espa]] on the [[planet]] [[Tatooine]]. At the time of the [[Invasion of Naboo]], Mushroom Mesa was part of the [[Boonta Eve Classic]] [[podracing]] circuit, forcing racers such as [[Anakin Skywalker]] to maneuver around the obstacles.<ref name="TPM" /> [[Standard year|Years]] later, Skywalker's son, [[Luke Skywalker|Luke]], [[pilot]]ed through Mushroom Mesa in his [[T-16 skyhopper|T-16 Skyhopper]].<ref name="SW15" /> Certain experienced racers believed that the faces that could be discerned in the stones of the mesa could change expressions depending on the angle of view.<ref name="SWCL">[[Star Wars: Complete Locations (2016)|''Star Wars: Complete Locations'']]</ref>

The Tusken Raiders were believed by some to know the secret of the Mesa. Whether they did or not is unknown, but they avoided the region "as if it were cursed."<ref name="SWCL" />

